---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "2026-08-31";
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | Category Checker" description="How Category Checker handles the domains you check and any analytics data.">
  <section class="wrap flex max-w-[720px] flex-col gap-6 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-[36px] font-medium leading-[1.15] tracking-[-0.5px] text-heading">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-[13px] text-fg-faint">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <h2 class="mt-4 text-[20px] font-medium text-heading">What we don't do</h2>
    <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fg">
      Category Checker does not require an account, does not sell data, and does not store the domains you check in any
      database. Domains you submit are sent only to this site's own API route to run the category lookup, and are not
      logged or persisted server-side.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-4 text-[20px] font-medium text-heading">Local storage</h2>
    <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fg">
      Your recently checked domains and theme preference are stored only in your browser's local storage, on your device.
      This data is never transmitted to us and can be cleared at any time using the "Clear" control or your browser's site
      data settings.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-4 text-[20px] font-medium text-heading">Analytics</h2>
    <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fg">
      This site may use privacy-respecting, cookie-free analytics (Plausible or Umami) to understand aggregate traffic —
      no personally identifiable information is collected, and no cross-site tracking is performed. Which provider, if
      any, is active is controlled by this deployment's environment configuration.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-4 text-[20px] font-medium text-heading">Third-party providers</h2>
    <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fg">
      When real provider integrations are enabled, the domain you submit is forwarded to that provider's API solely to
      retrieve its categorization. Refer to each provider's own privacy policy for how they handle that request.
    </p>

    <h2 class="mt-4 text-[20px] font-medium text-heading">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-fg">
      Questions about this policy can be directed via <a href="https://msnugget.com/" class="underline hover:text-heading">msnugget.com</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
